/target
/dist

# The release workflow stages the compiled library beside the manifest on the way into the
# .junodrv. Committing it means every build is a megabyte-sized binary diff, and a checkout
# on another platform gets a library it cannot load.
driver.wasm
driver-*.dylib
driver-*.so
driver-*.dll

# A driver builds as a cdylib, not a binary — the lock is not part of what ships.
Cargo.lock
